module jev_capability_discovery_investment_bridge

input natural_language_query
input discovery_observation
input discovery_query_digest
input discovery_provenance_digest
input declaration_scope_digest
input explicit_investment_target
input unresolved_capability_boundaries

status UNKNOWN discovery, scope, or policy evidence is not bound
status DEFERRED discovery evidence is incomplete or incomparable
status INVESTIGATE unresolved capability boundaries must be investigated first
status INVEST observed capability coverage is below the explicit target
status MAINTAIN observed capability coverage meets the explicit target

field disposition
field first_boundary
field discovery_query_digest
field discovery_provenance_digest
field declaration_scope_digest
field target_numerator
field target_denominator
field gap_numerator
field plan_digest

constraint discovery_precedes_investment
constraint target_is_policy_not_truth
constraint preserve_first_boundary
constraint preserve_discovery_provenance
constraint scope_and_target_are_explicit
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_mutation
